OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks aimed at police during
OL,4,Acar meet
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police vehicle has been damaged after
OL,7,Ffireworks were aimed at officers during
OL,8,Fa car meet.
OL,10,FPolice in Swindon, Wiltshire said staff
OL,11,Fhad been "put in danger" by a small
OL,12,Fgroup of people who "chose to put the
OL,13,Flives of those around them at risk by
OL,14,Fweaponising fireworks".
OL,16,FThere were no reported injuries but a
OL,17,Fpolice car was struck and damaged in
OL,18,Fthe incident, which took place at
OL,19,FDorcan Industrial Estate on 14
OL,20,FNovember.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
