OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks aimed at police during
OL,4,Acar meet
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Insp Sean Tregunna, of Wiltshire
OL,7,FPolice, said: "What our officers had to
OL,8,Fcontend with last night was completely
OL,9,Funacceptable. Their reckless actions
OL,10,Fplaced other members of the public,
OL,11,Fincluding those taking part in the car
OL,12,Fmeet, at real risk of serious injury."
